{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1311401001:1":{"text":"아, 다들 돌아오셨군요! 모든 종목을 즐기셨나요?","source_cn":"呀，你们回来了！你们已经玩过所有的项目了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E611A4322BCD0FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311401002:1":{"text":"...음, 그런 셈이지!","source_cn":"……呃，算是吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B0F8C7AB8A37FE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311401003:1":{"text":"우오! 정말 빠르시네요! 전 형 누나들과 함께 눈사람을 만들고 난 뒤에 눈싸움하러 갔다 왔어요. 그런 다음 돌아와서 또 눈사람을 만들었죠! 하나... 둘... 음...","source_cn":"真快啊！我和你们堆完雪人就去打雪仗，然后又回来堆雪人！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF6BF04E4E47F7A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311401004:1":{"text":"어라? 나중에 만든 눈사람은 다 어디 간 거지...? 내가 까먹었나...?","source_cn":"诶？我后来堆了几个雪人呢？怎么忘了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34297586D518541F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311401005:1":{"text":"꼬마야, 너무 많이 놀아서 지쳤나 보다~ 일단은 얼른 집으로 돌아가렴.","source_cn":"小朋友，你一定玩得很累了，还是先回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1E7DBC3ED9F5F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311401006:1":{"text":"네, 돌아가서 엄마가 만든 버섯 수프를 먹어야겠어요!","source_cn":"嗯，我要回去喝一大碗妈妈炖的蘑菇汤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x694A18B892AB1C31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:亚历克斯":{"text":"알렉스","source":"亚历克斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}